    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-ώδῠνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύνη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very painful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.238
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπὰς [ἔρωτος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.201.3
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Marian.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.583.5
				</span></i>
			 (Tanagra, V <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>suffering great pain</i> or <i>distress,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.111
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Glauc.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.386
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>).</div>
